	// (':', '@', '%', non-ASCII) would not round-trip correctly even
	// against compliant servers. validate() further rejects ClientID
	// values that ':' or non-VSCHAR bytes can't reach via this path
	// (RFC 7617 §2 + RFC 6749 §2.3.1).
